 \n\n    \n  </span>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md-sidebar md-sidebar--secondary\" data-md-component=\"sidebar\" data-md-type=\"toc\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"md-sidebar__scrollwrap\">\n<div class=\"md-sidebar__inner\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Table of contents\" class=\"md-nav md-nav--secondary\">\n<label class=\"md-nav__title\" for=\"__toc\">\n<span class=\"md-nav__icon md-icon\"></span>\n      Table of contents\n    </label>\n<ul class=\"md-nav__list\" data-md-component=\"toc\">\n<li class=\"md-nav__item\">\n<a class=\"md-nav__link\" href=\"#your-next-step\">\n<span class=\"md-ellipsis\">\n      \n        What brings you here?\n      \n    </span>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md-content\" data-md-component=\"content\">\n<article class=\"md-content__inner md-typeset\">\n<nav class=\"md-tags\" aria-label=\"Concept tags\">\n<span class=\"md-tag\">curriculum-current</span>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"wiki-home\" data-wiki-home=\"data-wiki-home\">\n<p><a class=\"wh-whats-new\" data-mk-no-hover-preview=\"1\" href=\"about/whats-new.html#2026-w44\"><span class=\"wh-whats-new-label\">What's new</span><span class=\"wh-whats-new-period\">26 October – 1 November 2026</span><span class=\"wh-whats-new-text\">Worked examples in Math I · Every page and AI check reviewed · Halloween limited-edition themes</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wh-whats-new-go\">→</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"wh-introduction-grid\">\n<section aria-labelledby=\"bsc-eor-wiki\" class=\"wh-hero\" id=\"wh-home-introduction\">\n<div class=\"wh-hero-copy\">\n<p class=\"wh-eyebrow\">University of Groningen · BSc EOR</p>\n<h1 id=\"bsc-eor-wiki\">Learn the ideas. <br><span>See the connections.</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#bsc-eor-wiki\" title=\"Permanent link\">¶</a></h1>\n<p class=\"wh-intro\">Your companion for Econometrics and Operations Research. Find a concept, work through its foundations, and build understanding that lasts.</p>\n<div class=\"wh-actions\">\n<p><a class=\"wh-button wh-button-primary\" href=\"Year-1/index.html\">Explore Year 1</a>\n<a class=\"wh-button wh-button-secondary\" href=\"find.html\">Find a concept →</a></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"wh-hero-note\">Definitions, worked intuition, prerequisites and practice — connected.</p>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wh-scene\">\n<div class=\"wh-scene-grid\"></div>\n<svg class=\"wh-orbits\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 430\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<ellipse cx=\"255\" cy=\"224\" rx=\"213\" ry=\"113\" transform=\"rotate(-27 255 224)\"></ellipse>\n<ellipse cx=\"255\" cy=\"224\" rx=\"202\" ry=\"156\" transform=\"rotate(33 255 224)\"></ellipse>\n<path d=\"M91 130 Q240 105 272 214 T433 295 M106 329 Q183 180 272 214 T393 103 M91 130 Q85 236 106 329 M393 103 Q448 165 433 295\"></path>\n<circle class=\"wh-orbit-halo\" cx=\"272\" cy=\"214\" r=\"49\"></circle><circle class=\"wh-orbit-core\" cx=\"272\" cy=\"214\" r=\"8\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"130\" r=\"5\"></circle><circle cx=\"106\" cy=\"329\" r=\"5\"></circle><circle cx=\"393\" cy=\"103\" r=\"5\"></circle><circle cx=\"433\" cy=\"295\" r=\"5\"></circle>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"wh-node wh-node-calculus\">Calculus<span>Change &amp; optimisation</span></span>\n<span class=\"wh-node wh-node-probability\">Probability<span>Reasoning with uncertainty</span></span>\n<span class=\"wh-node wh-node-algebra\">Linear algebra<span>Structure &amp; transformations</span></span>\n<span class=\"wh-node wh-node-models\">Models<span>From ideas to decisions</span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wh-galaxy-entry\"><a class=\"wh-galaxy-link\" href=\"galaxy.html\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wh-galaxy-star\">✦</span>Enter the Concept Galaxy</a></div>\n</section>\n<section aria-label=\"Daily concept\" class=\"wh-entry wh-daily\" data-daily-concept=\"data-daily-concept\" data-daily-state=\"failed\">\n<span class=\"wh-entry-number\">TODAY'S CONCEPT</span>\n<strong>One idea.<br>Eight questions.</strong>\n<span data-daily-status=\"\">Today's concept is temporarily unavailable.</span>\n<p class=\"wh-daily-intro\">A fresh concept from across the programme. Everyone takes the same daily check.</p>\n<div class=\"wh-daily-levels\"><span>3 easy</span><span>3 medium</span><span>2 difficult</span></div>\n<a class=\"wh-button wh-button-primary\" data-mk-no-hover-preview=\"1\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Try again</a>\n<p class=\"wh-daily-rewards\">Your first completion can earn XP, EORbits and EOR Rating within the usual limits. Repeats are practice.</p>\n<details>\n<summary>Mastery &amp; rewards</summary>\n<p>Your answers count toward the concept's mastery score. 7–8 correct suggests Mastered, 5–6 Clear, 3–4 Partial and 0–2 Unknown; choose Use as self-rating to save that level too. All rewards use the existing daily limits.</p>\n</details>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wh-coverage\">\n<p><strong>Start where the notes are strongest.</strong> <a href=\"Year-1/index.html\">Year 1</a> has the most developed concept coverage. <a href=\"Year-2/index.html\">Year 2</a> includes lecture-based notes and AI checks for Math V, Life Insurance, Game Theory and Risk Insurance, with coverage limits on their course pages; the other eight courses have placeholder hubs. <a href=\"Year-3/index.html\">Year 3</a> lists minor routes, thesis and course hubs; Stochastic Models has four foundation notes, with lecture placement pending.</p>\n</div>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"your-next-step\" class=\"wh-section\">\n<div class=\"wh-section-heading\">\n<p class=\"wh-eyebrow\">A place to begin</p>\n<h2 id=\"your-next-step\">What brings you here?<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#your-next-step\" title=\"Permanent link\">¶</a></h2>\n<p>Choose the task in front of you. You can change direction at any time.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wh-entry-grid\">\n<a class=\"wh-entry\" href=\"Year-1/index.html\"><span class=\"wh-entry-number\">01 / ORIENT</span><strong>Find your feet</strong><span>Start with your course. See how the concepts fit together before diving into the details.</span><span class=\"wh-entry-link\">Browse Year 1 →</span></a>\n<a class=\"wh-entry\" href=\"find.html\"><span class=\"wh-entry-number\">02 / UNDERSTAND</span><strong>Unpack an idea</strong><span>Find the definition, try an example, then follow the prerequisites when a step is missing.</span><span class=\"wh-entry-link\">Open Concept Finder →</span></a>\n<a class=\"wh-entry\" href=\"find.html#study-sets\"><span class=\"wh-entry-number\">03 / REVISE</span><strong>Make practice count</strong><span>Save a small set of concepts, then review them one at a time and mark each one done or skipped.</span><span class=\"wh-entry-link\">Open study sets →</span></a>\n<a class=\"wh-entry\" href=\"teaching.html\"><span class=\"wh-entry-number\">04 / TEACH</span><strong>Prepare to explain</strong><span>Trace the foundations of a topic and turn them into a focused tutorial or lesson.</span><span class=\"wh-entry-link\">Open Teaching workbench →</span></a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"wh-footer-links\">\n<p><a href=\"about/whats-new.html\">What's new</a> · <a href=\"about.html\">Site guide</a> · <a href=\"about.html#achievements-and-honours\">Achievements &amp; activities</a> · <a href=\"trending.html\">Rankings, EOR Rating &amp; monthly honours</a> · <a href=\"contributors.html\">Contributors</a> · <a href=\"mailto:w.zhu@rug.nl\">Corrections &amp; suggestions</a></p>\n<details>\n<summary>Optional activities &amp; personalisation</summary>\n<p>Personalise your workspace through <strong>My → Rewards → Store</strong>. XP and EORbits record activity; they are not course grades.</p>\n<p><strong>Find treasure while exploring.</strong> With a connected account, expanding nodes in the Nearby map can reveal bronze, silver, gold or crown chests with XP, EORbits and shop rewards. <a href=\"about.html#map-treasures\">See chances, guardians and rewards →</a></p>\n<p><strong>Agree a stake for your next challenge.</strong> Live duels and Ghost races offer optional EORbits stakes. Both players agree the amount; choose 0 to play without a stake. <a href=\"about.html#friendly-duels\">Read the challenge rules →</a></p>\n<p><strong>Collect course achievements.</strong> Each course with AI checks has its own achievements for clean checks, streaks and exploration. My → Rewards → Collection shows your progress and how many learners hold each one. <a href=\"about.html#achievements-and-honours\">See achievements and badges →</a></p>\n<p><strong>Weekend quizzes follow your courses.</strong> Choose Year 1 or Year 2 in Weekend events. Each competition draws ten questions from the week's taught topics, then from the current block's full available quiz pool after teaching ends; the event card shows the course scope. Semester 1 is scheduled so far; weekends without enough eligible questions have no competition. Earlier progress and honours are kept. <a href=\"about.html#weekend-events\">See the weekend programme and rules →</a></p>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n<button class=\"md-top md-icon\" data-md-component=\"top\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\" style=\"top: 70px;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M13 20h-2V8l-5.5 5.5-1.42-1.42L12 4.16l7.92 7.92-1.42 1.42L13 8z\"></path></svg>\n  Back to top\n</button>\n</main>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"mk-sidebar-drawer-ghost-floor\" class=\"md-sidebar--primary mk-sidebar-ghost-host\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div><aside id=\"mk-mobile-unified-sidebar-surface\" class=\"md-sidebar md-sidebar--primary mk-mobile-unified-sidebar-surface is-setup\" data-msb-unified-drawer=\"1\"></aside><div id=\"mk-mobile-drawer-backdrop-blur\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-msb-backdrop-bound=\"1\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"mk-mobile-search-backdrop\" style=\"position: fixed; inset: 0px; display: none; pointer-ev